WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the SapVid Video
Student Name: Natividad, Mark Lorenz P.
File Name: captions.vtt
Date: September 25, 2026

1
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:37.000
We have just concluded our retreat, and during the concluding Mass,
I shared a homily. I started with a story of a couple, a married couple.

2
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:50.000
They had been married for 25 years. Okay naman, ang kanilang samahan.
But at one point, the man discovered that his wife had someone else.

3
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:03.000
She had another illicit relationship.
He talked to his wife.

4
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:19.000
And the wife did not deny it. The man said,
"I will leave our house for one month, and I would like you to use
this period to reflect and finally decide."

5
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:34.000
"Are you still my wife, or do you now belong to someone else?"
Nabanggit ko po yan kasi this is also very important in our life.

6
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Sometimes, it is as if God also asks us,
"Are you still mine? Sa akin ka pa ba? Sa akin ka pa ba?"

7
00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:08.000
"Or does someone else already own your life?"
Your possessions, others? Or maybe I am just one of the stakeholders
who owns a part of you?

8
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:23.000
"And I am even the one with the smallest share of you."
It is a question that we need to reflect on.
Let us not take this for granted.

9
00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Mahirap kapag pagdating ng araw, iba na ang nagmamay-ari sa atin.
It is difficult when the day comes that someone else owns us.

10
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:56.000
Aluwa ne ing kukumpas king kekatambiye.
Aluwa ne ing apung ginu.

11
00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:14.000
I hope and pray that these bells will remind us always
that we belong to God. That we belong to Christ.

12
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:33.000
At when we hear this bells rings, You should not just say to your child,
"Hoy, simba naka, mortal sin kanyan, malutu naka kanyan king impyerno kanyan."

13
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:49.000
No. We wish that this bells, this will be their voice,
will remind us, "I belong to God."

14
00:03:49.000 --> 00:04:05.000
And if we belong to God, everything belongs to Him.
